    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Overlaps";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The exemption is related to the temporal interval between registration and commencement dates.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) If: ... (a) regulations are expressed to commence from a date (the registration date) before the regulations are registered under the Legislation Act 2003;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "then a court must not convict the person of an offence, or order the person to pay a pecuniary penalty, in relation to the conduct on the grounds that it contravened a provision of this Act.";
