    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) Section 149B, subsection 149C(1) and section 149D apply in relation to a modern award that: (a) is made on or after 1 January 2014; or (b) is made before 1 January 2014 and that is varied on or after that day under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted by Schedule 1 to the amending Act).";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(a) Section 149B, subsection 149C(1) and section 149D apply in relation to a modern award that: (a) is made on or after 1 January 2014; or (b) is made before 1 January 2014 and that is varied on or after that day under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted by Schedule 1 to the amending Act).";
